{"3991880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Adventure Seekers: Lost to Sea Collector's Edition", "steam_appid": 3991880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3991930], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991880/extras/55af3c1f6f0b0eeb7058f2b58d7db930.avif?t=1768284087\" width=1200 height=460 /></span><br>Welcome to the Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure — a story-focused, point-and-click experience where every location invites you to explore. Players scan richly illustrated scenes to spot specific items cleverly tucked into the environment, while also tackling interactive puzzles and mini-games that advance the story and challenge problem-solving skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991880/extras/1b4cd7a29418430cce8438512038644b.poster.avif?t=1768284087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991880/extras/1b4cd7a29418430cce8438512038644b.webm?t=1768284087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991880/extras/1b4cd7a29418430cce8438512038644b.mp4?t=1768284087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a devastating shipwreck, Rafael awakens on a secluded island with no memory of his past. Survival feels hopeless until Inara — a mysterious young woman from the Tekua tribe — rescues him. But this island is far from idyllic: ancient secrets echo through the jungle, legends speak of hidden treasure, and danger lurks behind every wave. As Rafael earns the tribe’s trust and uncovers fragments of his forgotten life, a pirate raid shatters the fragile peace. With Inara captured and Captain Rodrigo claiming to know Rafael’s true identity, one question becomes unavoidable: who can you trust when even your own past is uncertain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an adventure filled with atmospheric locations and engaging challenges. From classic hidden-object scenes to inventive mini-games, every step offers a fresh puzzle to unravel and a new mystery to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991880/extras/f5a3094870f86b573cd9ab3c37f7c280.poster.avif?t=1768284087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991880/extras/f5a3094870f86b573cd9ab3c37f7c280.webm?t=1768284087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991880/extras/f5a3094870f86b573cd9ab3c37f7c280.mp4?t=1768284087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 Explore thriving jungles, hidden coves, and the ruins of a long-lost shipwreck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 Defend the Tekua tribe from ruthless pirate assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 Uncover the myth of an ancient treasure buried deep within the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 Hunt for an abundance of hidden objects and collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 Discover clues that reveal the truth behind Rafael’s forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 Solve dozens of mini-games and puzzles that test both logic and perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 Reveal secrets through interactive exploration scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 Earn achievements that showcase your progress and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on a journey of memory, mystery, and discovery. The island is waiting for you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991880/extras/55af3c1f6f0b0eeb7058f2b58d7db930.avif?t=1768284087\" width=1200 height=460 /></span><br>Welcome to the Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure — a story-focused, point-and-click experience where every location invites you to explore. Players scan richly illustrated scenes to spot specific items cleverly tucked into the environment, while also tackling interactive puzzles and mini-games that advance the story and challenge problem-solving skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991880/extras/1b4cd7a29418430cce8438512038644b.poster.avif?t=1768284087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991880/extras/1b4cd7a29418430cce8438512038644b.webm?t=1768284087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991880/extras/1b4cd7a29418430cce8438512038644b.mp4?t=1768284087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a devastating shipwreck, Rafael awakens on a secluded island with no memory of his past. Survival feels hopeless until Inara — a mysterious young woman from the Tekua tribe — rescues him. But this island is far from idyllic: ancient secrets echo through the jungle, legends speak of hidden treasure, and danger lurks behind every wave. As Rafael earns the tribe’s trust and uncovers fragments of his forgotten life, a pirate raid shatters the fragile peace. With Inara captured and Captain Rodrigo claiming to know Rafael’s true identity, one question becomes unavoidable: who can you trust when even